      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2017986643,
          "type": null,
          "body": "I prefer (1). My read of the [GQueue documentation](https://docs.gtk.org/glib/struct.Queue.html) is that the list is explicitly considered a public field, so this is fine (and perhaps the preferred way for performance reasons.)",
